# Content publishing schedule

## Rhythm (ongoing)

- **2 posts per week** — each publish day ships **blog + LinkedIn on the same evening**
- **Publish days:** **Tuesday and Thursday only** — no Friday (low evening engagement)
- **Time window:** ~7:30–9:30 PM IST (deploy blog earlier; LinkedIn after verify)
- **Buffer:** Finish the next post before the prior publish day; Tue/Thu are ship-only

## If a slot slips

| Missed | Move to |
|--------|---------|
| Tuesday | Following Thursday (not Friday) |
| Thursday | Following Tuesday |
| Whole week | Drop the lighter post; never skip Kafka 2–style series anchors |

