## LinkedIn (same evening as blog)

- Problem-first hook, 3 bullets, one deep link, one question
- Run LinkedIn Post Inspector on new URLs before posting
- Reply to comments in the first hour when possible

## Priority if overloaded

1. Kafka series momentum (homepage Start here)
2. Algorithm guides (proven format)
3. Defer JS or comparison posts before deferring Kafka 2 / Trees

## After September

Continue **Tue + Thu evening** rhythm unless the user changes it. Extend Kafka (lag, rebalances, ops) and Algorithms (DFS, DP intro) in the same cadence.
